Meeting summary for 28 January 2026:

*Updated: Release 2.7*
  Since we're still merging too many bugfixes, we decided to
  do another RC (rc6) today instead of the planned 2.7.0. So
  2.7.0 is delayed by another two weeks.

*Updated: community meetup 2026*
  When: exact date to be determined, poll is still running
  Dates can be entered here: https://nuudel.digitalcourage.de/VnbRxE6iKdWECLbW
  Current top pick is October 17/18
  Where: Tentatively in Paderborn, Germany.
  Meeting room:
  Potentially https://www.welcome-hotels.com/en/hotels/paderborn/events/

*Updated: mbedtls (>= 4) support*
  mbedtls 4 support has been merged into master, so will be available in
  2.7.0. There are still some open issues, but it is separated from
  mbedtls3 support, so shouldn't break anything for existing users.
  Currently only AES-GCM and Chacha-Poly ciphers are supported, but
  more might be added.

As always you're welcome to join at #openvpn-meeting on Libera IRC network
every Wednesday at 14:00 Central European Time.

